@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Enqueue a support ticket (returns 202 + Queued)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Production API is down",
  "description": "Every customer receives server errors and cannot place orders",
  "requesterEmail": "ops@example.com"
}

### Get processed ticket
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1

### Add human gold label
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Technical",
  "priority": "Urgent",
  "reviewer": "student"
}

### Settings and gold counter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/settings

### Model versions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/models

